pan><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把你的吉他和衣服扔到后座上</span></p><p begin="14.104" end="15.571" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.104" end="14.799">my</span> <span begin="14.799" end="15.571">love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的爱人</span></p><p begin="15.755" end="18.027" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.755" end="15.889">they</span> <span begin="15.889" end="16.301">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="16.301" end="17.214">underst</span><span begin="17.214" end="18.027">and</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们不会明白</span></p><p begin="18.127" end="22.946" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.127" end="18.295">but</span> <span begin="18.295" end="18.647">i&apos;ll</span> <span begin="18.647" end="19.063">hold</span> <span begin="19.063" end="19.314">your</span> <span begin="19.314" end="19.764">hurt</span> <span begin="19.914" end="20.228">in</span> <span begin="20.228" end="20.444">the</span> <span begin="20.444" end="21.053">box</span> <span begin="21.053" end="21.546">here</span> <span begin="21.546" end="22.330">beside</span> <span begin="22.330" end="22.946">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我会将你的伤痛放进身边的盒子里</span></p><p begin="24.280" end="26.362" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.280" end="24.678">how</span> <span begin="24.678" end="24.880">could</span> <span begin="24.880" end="25.505">we</span> <span begin="25.505" end="26.362">know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们怎么会知道</span></p><p begin="26.629" end="32.765" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.629" end="27.157">we&apos;d</span> <span begin="27.157" end="28.391">rearrange</span> <span begin="28.391" end="28.703">all</span> <span begin="28.703" end="28.991">the</span> <span begin="28.991" end="29.693">cosm</span><span begin="29.693" end="30.888">os,</span> <span begin="31.141" end="32.765">mmm?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们有能力改变整个宇宙</span></p><p begin="33.430" end="35.965" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.430" end="33.828">we</span> <span begin="33.828" end="34.294">crashed</span> <span begin="34.294" end="34.478">and</span> <span begin="34.478" end="35.060">we</span> <span begin="35.060" end="35.965">burned</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们曾搞糟一切</span></p><p begin="35.965" end="40.248" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.965" end="36.330">now</span> <span begin="36.330" end="36.664">i</span> <span begin="36.664" end="36.930">just</span> <span begin="36.930" end="37.429">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="37.429" end="37.841">go</span> <span begin="37.841" end="38.264">where</span> <span begin="38.264" end="38.480">you</span> <span begin="38.480" end="39.068">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="39.068" end="40.248">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我不想去你未曾去过的地方</span></p><p begin="40.700" end="43.333" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.700" end="41.127">and</span> <span begin="41.127" end="41.935">u</span><span begin="41.935" end="42.353">sually</span> <span begin="42.353" end="43.333">i&apos;m</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">通常我</span></p><p begin="43.849" end="44.898" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.849" end="44.272">fucked</span> <span begin="44.272" end="44.898">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">狼狈不堪</span></p><p begin="45.130" end="46.114" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.130" end="46.114">anxious</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">焦躁不安</span></p><p begin="46.281" end="47.248" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.281" end="46.668">too</span> <span begin="46.668" end="47.248">much</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难以自控</span></p><p begin="47.466" end="51.294" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.466" end="47.650">but</span> <span begin="47.650" end=